            "text": "<b>No new tool.</b> Every drawer message carries <code>context</code> — route, sidebar title, tab, the date range the URL names, and the product / order / store id the URL names. Only what the URL actually says: a page on its silent default sends no range, so the analyst is never told a period the page did not show.",
