            "full": "The analyst’s prompt gained a <b>platform map</b>: all 24 pages, their tabs (the names the in-app docs use), what each shows and which of the 63 tools feed it — so it can point you to the screen by name (“that’s under Inventory Analyst › Dead Stock”). The stale line claiming no external systems are connected was corrected.",
